              "description": "Links to other tasks of the workspace, e.g. [{\"kind\": \"blocked_by\", \"task\": 8}], at most 20, one per task. The other task gets the inverse link (blocks ⇄ blocked_by, relates ⇄ relates). On update the list replaces the links ([] clears)."
